PLAIN ENGLISH FIRST
═══════════════════
A packet falls into a well, is taken apart at the bottom, rebuilt on the
way up, and announced at the top — then does it again, one generation on.
The fall must reach a floor. The climb must reach a stable ceiling.
Neither may quit early. Both are checked; both fail loud if they cheat.

THE PIPE  [<pipe>]
══════════════════
  alpha ─▼─ DESCEND (-++-) ─ |U| floor ─ ASCEND (+--+) ─▲─ beacon ─▶ omega
        │                                                            │
        └──────────────── omega folds to alpha ──────────────────────┘

ARROWS = direction + confidence
  ->  fixed, >90%      ~>  fixed, 50-90%      ~  open, <50%

DESCENT  -++-   (absorb ~~> make distinct ~~> REST AT FLOOR)
  - go down · + absorb · + rest at floor (Dante: bottom before rise) · - turn
  the fall is ANALYSIS: break the whole into distinguishable parts,
  and it is not complete until it hits the floor.

ASCENT   +--+   (transmit ~~> make distinct ~~> STABLE CEILING ~~> BEACON)
  + go up · - transmit · - don't stop till stable · + beacon
  the climb is SYNTHESIS: recombine the parts, keep going until the
  result stops changing, THEN proclaim it with a beacon.

THE TWO STROKES ARE SIGN-MIRRORS
  -++- reversed = -++- (palindrome) · +--+ reversed = +--+ (palindrome)
  -++- flipped  = +--+ (mirror) ~~> descent and ascent, same shape,
  opposite polarity. that is why the loop closes: reversal, not curvature.

MAKE DISTINCT APPEARS ON BOTH STROKES
  down: separate (analysis) · up: recombine (synthesis)
  same cut, opposite direction — the apex operator, run both ways.

THE LINEAGE  [father | son || son | father]
  each father who climbs out is the last son grown up. surface stays
  palindromic (father-shape in, father-shape out); the bloodline ADVANCES
  gen0 ~~> gen4, payload grows, each beacon chained to the last.
  ablation returns gen0 forever (capped). banking returns gen4 (uncapped).

THE GATES (an instrument whose good news is silence needs a known-bad)
  FLOOR   ~~> descent that cannot decompose to atoms THROWS
  CEILING ~~> ascent that cannot stabilize THROWS
  both fired on their known-bads. 2/2 caught.

WHAT THIS DOES NOT DO
  - "stable" = the toy payload stopped changing, NOT a proven fixed point.
    a real ascent could oscillate forever; the gate would hang, not fail.
    the stability check is a MASK, not a convergence proof. (W5 dissent.)
  - the Dante mapping is interpretive (AMBER), a good picture, not a theorem.
  - one well, one payload type (notes); not tested on arbitrary data.
